description:
This is a Notice to announce the award of four Suppliers to a Framework for the supply of Rock Salt in 5 lots to East Riding of Yorkshire Council, Hull City Council and North Lincolnshire Council&#039;s Winter Services Teams for the duration 01 October 2024 to 30 September 2028. The 5 Lots are:
Lot 1 - 6mm Bulk Rock Salt;
Lot 2 - 10mm Bulk Rock Salt;
Lot 3 - Bulk Pre-wetting (Marine) Salt;
Lot 4 - Bagged Marine Salt;
Lot 5 - 6.3mm Coated Bulk Rock Salt.
Two Suppliers are awarded to each of the five Lots within this Framework, with one in first place and another in second place. All awarded Suppliers have met the Selection Criteria. The first ranked Supplier will be awarded the business on a call off basis; unless they are unable to do so then the next highest ranked Supplier will be approached. Each order placed under this Framework will constitute an individual call off contract.
